    <div class="fq-ask">
      <div class="fq-pills"><button type="button" class="fq-pill is-on" data-g="0">Company</button><button type="button" class="fq-pill" data-g="1">Security &amp; Data</button><button type="button" class="fq-pill" data-g="2">General &amp; Integrations</button></div>
      <div class="fq-chips"><button type="button" class="fq-chip" data-g="0" data-i="0-0">Why partner with Sage.is for open-source incubation?</button><button type="button" class="fq-chip" data-g="0" data-i="0-1">How long have you been around? Can we trust you as our incubation partner?</button><button type="button" class="fq-chip" data-g="0" data-i="0-2">What about the reliability of your technical support and OSS solutions?</button><button type="button" class="fq-chip" data-g="0" data-i="0-3">What if our partnership doesn't fit after we start?</button><button type="button" class="fq-chip" data-g="0" data-i="0-4">Can I ask the founders a question directly about incubation?</button><button type="button" class="fq-chip" data-g="0" data-i="0-5">Can we transition from proprietary tools to your open-source incubation model?</button><button type="button" class="fq-chip" data-g="1" data-i="1-0" hidden>Is Sage open‑source? Can we self‑host?</button><button type="button" class="fq-chip" data-g="1" data-i="1-1" hidden>How secure is Sage?</button><button type="button" class="fq-chip" data-g="1" data-i="1-2" hidden>Is our data backed up? How often?</button><button type="button" class="fq-chip" data-g="1" data-i="1-3" hidden>Where are the servers that store our data?</button><button type="button" class="fq-chip" data-g="1" data-i="1-4" hidden>Do you support compliance needs (SOC 2, GDPR, HIPAA)?</button><button type="button" class="fq-chip" data-g="1" data-i="1-5" hidden>Can you fill our custom security questionnaires?</button><button type="button" class="fq-chip" data-g="1" data-i="1-6" hidden>Can I export our data if we ever want to leave?</button><button type="button" class="fq-chip" data-g="2" data-i="2-0" hidden>Is Sage for teams?</button><button type="button" class="fq-chip" data-g="2" data-i="2-1" hidden>Does Sage have an API? Can we integrate with Sage?</button><button type="button" class="fq-chip" data-g="2" data-i="2-2" hidden>What if we need more help?</button><button type="button" class="fq-chip" data-g="2" data-i="2-3" hidden>Is Sage available in languages other than English?</button><button type="button" class="fq-chip" data-g="2" data-i="2-4" hidden>If we go with Sage, will we still need stuff like ChatGPT? Perplexity? Dropbox?</button><button type="button" class="fq-chip" data-g="2" data-i="2-5" hidden>What kind of companies, in which industries, use Sage?</button><button type="button" class="fq-chip" data-g="2" data-i="2-6" hidden>What’s the developer experience like?</button></div>
