port compliance needs (SOC 2, GDPR, HIPAA)?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button></li><li><button type="button" class="fq-iq" data-k="11"><b>Q12</b><span>Can you fill our custom security questionnaires?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button></li><li><button type="button" class="fq-iq" data-k="12"><b>Q13</b><span>Can I export our data if we ever want to leave?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button></li></ol></section><section class="fq-igroup"><h3>03 / GENERAL &amp; INTEGRATIONS <span>I have other questions…</span></h3><ol><li><button type="button" class="fq-iq" data-k="13"><b>Q14</b><span>Is Sage for teams?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button></li><li><button type="button" class="fq-iq" data-k="14"><b>Q15</b><span>Does Sage have an API? Can we integrate with Sage?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button></li><li><button type="button" class="fq-iq" data-k="15"><b>Q16</b><span>What if we need more help?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button></li><li><button type="button" class="fq-iq" data-k="16"><b>Q17</b><span>Is Sage available in languages other than English?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button></li><li><button type="button" class="fq-iq" data-k="17"><b>Q18</b><span>If we go with Sage, will we still need stuff like ChatGPT? Perplexity? Dropbox?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button></li><li><button type="button" class="fq-iq" data-k="18"><b>Q19</b><span>What kind of companies, in which industries, use Sage?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button></li><li><button type="button" class="fq-iq" data-k="19"><b>Q20</b><span>What’s the developer experience like?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button></li></ol></section></div>
